  'Table of entries to an online science fair by region for 2023, 2024 and 2025: Asia 1,850, 2,400 and 3,100; Africa 420, 760 and 1,300; Europe 1,600, 1,650 and 1,700; North America 1,300, 1,250 and 1,280; South America 380, 520 and 690; Oceania 150, 170 and 180; totals 5,700, 6,750 and 8,250.',
